Package: reprokit
Title: Reproduce and Check Results When Raw Data Cannot Be Shared
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helps authors who cannot share raw data report the sufficient
    statistics that let readers reproduce their results exactly, or decide
    that synthetic data or the raw data are needed. Helps readers check
    whether reported test statistics are consistent with each other. Every
    output requires a stated reason for not sharing and lists what readers
    lose, because sharing raw data remains the standard.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dm-k1/reprokit
BugReports: https://github.com/dm-k1/reprokit/issues
